2. Re-run isolated `test_cross_write_read` ×3 (instr=0). **Validation signal:** P75-INSTR (`REL-LEFT-DIRTY ... pinned=N`) should now read pinned=0; no `ltbno+ltlen>bno` shutdown; check the new P73-FIX log fires (confirms pinned bnobt buffers are being drained).
